"""
=========================================
Day 02 - Python Lists


Goal:
Learn how to create, access, modify and
process lists in Python.

Topics Covered:
✓ Creating Lists
✓ Indexing
✓ Negative Indexing
✓ Slicing
✓ append()
✓ extend()
✓ insert()
✓ remove()
